  "content": "\n\n<p>將<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bag of Holding</a>的材質替換為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-companion-backpacks-etc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explorers Companion</a>的背包材質。</p>\n<p>衷心感謝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lord_of_crumbs/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lord_Of_Crumbs</a>允許使用這些材質！</p>\n<p>若您希望遊戲介面配色與新背包相符，請使用位於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/explorers-bag-of-holding/files/7136004\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>的數據包。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1365/194/main-png.png\" alt=\"\"> 現已同時支援<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Backpacks</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Useful Backpacks</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
